          "@type": "Review",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "sofih16"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Wonderful full days tuition photographing the Peak District, Padley Gorge & Bolehill Quarry.  Although I had had a camera for 10 years and I had been using the bare minimum of functions Alan was able to teach me some technical skills that I will be able to use in my photography going forward.  Alan is incredibly knowledgeable and was able to tailor his teaching to everyone’s individual level, which I was very grateful for.  I am really pleased with the photos I managed to capture on the day. Thank you Alan for a fantastic day and sharing your photography knowledge.",
          "reviewRating": {
            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": "5",
            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "datePublished": "2026-11-03",
