          },
          "comment": {
            "@type": "Comment",
            "author": {
              "@type": "Organization",
              "name": "Alan Ranger Photography"
            },
            "text": "Thanks Sophie, much appreciated and i know you loved the mushrooms (too much lol)  was a pleasure to have you ain the group on the day and i hope you will continue to visit both locations again with new insights and improved visual observation and camera skills"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "John MacDonald"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Peak District Photography Workshop - Padley Gorge & Bolehill Quarry - Fantastic day out with Alan with fantastic autumn colours. Alan was very helpful in helping with the right exposure settings to really make the most of the locations. The input and help were focussed on where I needed the help, then leaving me to put it into practice. Great day with the group and would recommend.",
          "reviewRating": {
            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": "5",
            "bestRating": "5",
