            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Tony McKenna"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Full day photography course at Padley Gorge. Forest and landscape. Excellent location, well managed timescale and massively informative throughout. Alan’s a thoroughly nice guy who knows his stuff. Worth every single penny and every minute of your time!  JPG’s  only uploaded because have not long been back.",
