            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Cherie Lewis"
          },
          "reviewBody": "We had a fabulous day of photography in Padley Gorge and Boleshill Quarry. Alan was a great tutor - incredibly patient and informative. I learnt a lot in a short space of time and it was great to be able to put that learning into practice in a stunning location. Alan had a brilliant knowledge of the area and helped us to ‘see’ the opportunities first and foremost before looking at the technical. A brilliant day -,Alan looked after us from beginning to end and made sure we each got the most out of the session. Thank you!",
